{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Demo save data</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*At this time, save data from demo<strong>\u00a0</strong>will <strong>not</strong> be automatically carried over to the full version. We are currently working to enable automatic transfer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish to transfer your data, please follow the steps below:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your library, select demo, then click the gear icon \u2192 Manage \u2192 Browse local files to open the folder. <br>Do the same on the full version side to open its folder.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Copy the two JSON files, savefile and device_setting, from the demo\u2019s folder and paste them into the full version\u2019s folder.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is made up of small continents, each inhabited by a variety of creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark Army has been lurking in the shadows, waiting for the right moment to consume the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the guardian deity, you have risen to protect these small continents from their evil grasp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/9f9becdc44f395025018069cbaacb7cc.avif?t=1764318446\" width=1560 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a card-based simulation strategy game where you defend the world from the Dark Army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you\u2019ve chosen a mission to take on, pick your favorite cards, build your deck, and jump into the battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls are very simple\u2014just select a card and choose its target! Use your cards to reshape the terrain, grant blessings or impose trials upon the people, and prepare the land for the threats to come!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/91e90537ebfddae05953d8789e8da94a.avif?t=1764318446\" width=1560 height=1250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can influence the world only through the cards. Use three types of cards to expand Groups, advance their development, and guide Units on their path to becoming legendary heroes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/0cc734b68185a24e81c663dac43a40e0.avif?t=1764318446\" width=1560 height=2674 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514950/extras/d72e502af679d43e42df4b5a71b62a05.avif?t=1764318446\" width=620 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defense Mission: Protect the continent from the Dark Army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mission: Take on a variety of unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Play: Enjoy the game with no time limits or objectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other features include an Observation Room, where you can review elements discovered during gameplay, and a Reincarnation Room, where you can set names and dialogue for in-game units, among other features.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game permits monetization through partner programs on video and/or live streaming platforms, such as YouTube.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to Mini Continental Saga!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2514950/b6a8a5989ab83c47749a10aeb3274f3a69f14ec0.jpg"},{"name":"Lesson One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2514950/b29178338406b16352ad504